sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/run/morphogenesis-cognition-gene-overlap--grok-4-7--1--2026-11-01> a prov:Activity ;
    rdfs:label "Run of approach morphogenesis-cognition-gene-overlap--grok-4-7--1 (2026-11-01): completed, did not settle its target" ;
    dct:description "Pleiotropy-matched overlap of GO morphogenesis and learning-or-memory genes over 19,276 HGNC protein-coding genes, null of 10,000 label permutations within strata of GO annotation count and INDRA CoGEx statement degree, IEA excluded. Full set: OR 5.96 (95% CI 4.02 to 8.83), matched-null median OR 2.62, p = 0.0002, pass. Ion channels: OR 8.02, p = 0.23, fail. Gap junctions: underpowered. Verdict mixed (0.6). The failure signature (full-set OR inside the matched null) is not met, but the bioelectric subsets the claim names do not pass; conflicts in direction with the parent mouse test of the same claim." ;

    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/problem/morphogenesis-cognition-gene-overlap> ;
